  <p>
    The constructor registers each speed name twice as per-cell profiles,
    <code>name</code> and <code>name:tension</code>, through <code>_profileFor</code>:
    <code>minimumSpinTime = (profile.minimumSpinTime ?? 320) + stagger(...)</code>,
    plus <code>TENSION_EXTRA_MS = 1100</code> for the tension variant.
    <code>tense</code> is evaluated once per wave against the pre-wave state and
    only applies when at least one cell spins. On each <code>coin:locked</code>
    the driver plays the lock animation: <code>'win'</code> waits for an
    in-progress <code>symbol.landing</code>, <code>'landing'</code> does not
    replay it; failures are logged as <code>hw-coin-&lt;anim&gt;-failed</code>.
  </p>

